  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The displacement equation of a particle is given by&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>The velocity equation is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>The above equation represents&nbsp;an ellipse.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8030a3c7-898f-46d8-b4bf-97f1ca5755c3-image.png\" style=\"width: 242px; height: 170px;\" /></p></blockquote>",
